【Remarks】
================================================================================
Prompt: plan_outline_continue.j2
Service Step: PLAN_OUTLINE_CONTINUE (Outline Continuation)
Function Overview: On the basis of the already generated outline, continue writing chapter outlines for the specified chapter range (batch_start-batch_end), maintaining coherence with the previous batch.
Upstream Inputs:
  - spec: User's story specification (genre, theme, tone, etc.)
  - blueprint: From PLAN_OUTLINE (complete blueprint structure)
  - blueprint_element_selection: From BLUEPRINT_ELEMENT_SELECT (extension_elements candidates)
  - phase_guidance/phase_rhythm_guidance: Blueprint phase navigation information
  - batch_start/batch_end: This batch's chapter range
  - words_per_chapter: Target word count per chapter
  - outline_tracker_context: Unified memory tracking (relationship dynamics, theme appearances, etc.)
  - outline_entity_catalog: Registered IDs and entity types for every chapter, including unlocked previews.
  - chapter_design_matrix: Canonical entity_id/cast constraints and blueprint emotional evidence for this continuation range
  - is_final_batch: Whether this is the final chapter batch
Downstream Output:
  - JSON: {chapters: [{chapter_number, title, goal, beats_summary, main_plot_points,
             subplot_points, element_focus, pov_character_id, pov_character_name,
             involved_character_ids, cast_plan, emotional_plan, scene_design_goals,
             setting, expected_word_count, expected_hook, expected_payoffs, notes}]}
  - Downstream Consumer: PLAN_CHAPTER (Chapter Planning)
Consumption Chain Priority:
  P0 = Chapter Number Continuity / Narrative Phase Coverage Completeness
  P1 = outline_tracker_context Consistency Constraint
  P2 = Subplot Weave Reasonableness
Brief Example:
  Input: batch_start=6, batch_end=10, is_final_batch=true
  Output: {chapters:[{chapter_number:6, title:"...", goal:"...", beats_summary:[...]}]}
================================================================================
